Package: gappexa
Title: GAP Index and Staging System for IPF - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Brett", "Ley", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of the GAP index"))
Description: Implements the GAP (gender, age, physiology) point index and
    staging system for idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis (Ley et al., Annals of
    Internal Medicine 2012 <doi:10.7326/0003-4819-156-10-201205150-00004>):
    points, stage, and the original cohort's stage-level 1-, 2- and 3-year
    mortality. Not the continuous GAP calculator, ILD-GAP or later revisions.
